lines=['# Freedoom / HydraPy / Gorgon — four-minute polyphonic live take','','Decisions for Josiah: none required for delivery. Claude Code reviews and pushes codex/doom-poly-take. Studio keyboard and game-event signals remain optional follow-ups.','','The 240-second 1080p30 MP4 and stereo 48 kHz/24-bit WAV are from one simultaneous live Rack/Studio capture. All four compositions play complete. No note reduction, offline substitute synth, multitrack stem passes, or commercial Doom assets were used.','','## Evidence','','- '+f"{gate['source_note_ons']:,} MIDI note-ons → {gate['emitted_note_ons']:,} emitted → {gate['observed_gate_edges']:,} observed physical cable edges; zero missing events across 18 polyphonic synth instances.",'- Compiler tests passed tempo changes, sustain, RPN bend ranges, source pitches/velocities/times, and non-stealing allocation. Gate audit proves cable delivery/capacity; it is not acoustic note recognition.','- Gorgon prewarm was enabled, ran, and held compilation for the take; compiled count: '+str(d['prewarm']['compiled'])+'.','- Held slots: 64 / 7,200 (0.889%). JACK capture: zero xruns and zero recorded audio discontinuities.','- Studio source producer: 1 underrun; 4 late packets for the session, with 3 during Play by summary-window estimate. These optical producer counters are separate from the recorded Rack mix.','- All 7,137 sampled video frames matched floor(35 × tracker seconds within the active demo). Zero tic mismatches.','- Paired 1 Hz video/audio gates: raw fitted drift '+f"{sync['drift_over_take_ms']:.2f} ms; after alignment/rate correction {sync['corrected_drift_ms']:.2f} ms across the take. Video measurement resolution is 33.33 ms, so these sub-frame estimates are not sample-accurate A/V claims.",'- Audio alignment: '+f"{sync['applied_audio_trim_seconds']*1000:.3f} ms trim (negative means padding); nominal capture rate adjusted to {sync['applied_capture_rate']} then resampled to 48 kHz. Applied one global gain, preserving relative MIDI dynamics.",'- Final MP4 fully decoded; exactly 7,200 video frames, four chapters. WAV exactly 240 seconds. Inspected 32 frames across all minutes of that FINAL MP4, plus its final game frame. See review/.','- No listening review is claimed. Audio review was numeric: nonzero stereo mix, bounded peak, clean capture clock and gate accounting.','','## Complete music and official credits','','| Start–end | Freedoom lump | Composition | Credit |','|---|---|---|---|']
