lines+=['','Terminal, print, Rutt Etra scan and feedback scenes switch at 0, 60, 120 and 180 s. Gorgon drives both the visual clock and a linear absolute-time CV lane; Doom advances exactly 35 tics/s of that clock. The stream reads absolute time rather than counting edges. No demo segment repeats.','','## Instruments and limits','','See INSTRUMENTS.md and inventory.json for every channel, substitute preset, allocated voice count and installed binary hash. CZish: eight voices in single-line mode; Vastish: eight; OTIS Sampler: up to sixteen mono voices. Eighteen instances cover the complete note stream. OTIS uses eight original synthesized drum families with distinct relative pitches, avoiding Kit-slot retrigger stealing. Spoon Bender supplies stereo effects; Seance was inventoried but unused. These are timbre substitutions, not General MIDI replicas.','', 'Held MIDI lengths, attacks and velocity are preserved. Mod wheel is substituted by 5 Hz vibrato; substitute release tails are bounded by one-second retirement after note-off. The automation clock coasts through each pattern’s final-row hold and re-anchors at the next pattern.','', 'An isolated SysV namespace shim worked around stale slots in the workstation’s JACK1 registry without deleting those records or changing system packages. Captures ran one at a time; no Blender render/capture was running when the final take began. Failed diagnostic takes are retained outside take/ for audit.','','## Reproduction','','Code: ../doom-hydrapy/ on branch codex/doom-poly-take. Build the engine with make -C doomgeneric -f Makefile.ipc; build poly/ against Rack SDK and its namespace shim. Run test_music.py, setup_take.py --smoke, and run_capture.sh smoke before the full setup_take.py / run_capture.sh poly. Scripts use explicit workstation paths. finalize_take.py packages media; finish_delivery.py --visual-reviewed records manual review. All GPL engine/plugin code stays in the standalone repository; HydraPy/Gorgon checkouts were untouched.','','Commit: '+d['git_commit']+'. Codex did not push.']
